  "items": [
    {
      "item_id": "A01",
      "section": "A",
      "text": "当别人当众让我难堪时，我通常需要一段时间才能平静下来",
      "source_evidence": "受到刺激后的愤怒持续时间；情绪恢复困难",
      "source_evidence_category": "情绪失控",
      "variable_ids": [
        "PV01"
      ],
      "context_only": false,
      "operational_mapping_status": "needs_review",
      "response_options": null,
      "score_rule": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "A02",
      "section": "A",
      "text": "如果我觉得别人是故意针对我，我会反复想着这件事",
      "source_evidence": "认为他人故意伤害；持续反刍",
      "source_evidence_category": "敌意解释",
      "variable_ids": [
        "PV03"
      ],
      "context_only": false,
      "operational_mapping_status": "needs_review",
      "response_options": null,
      "score_rule": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "A03",
      "section": "A",
      "text": "受到不公平对待后，我有时会想让对方也感受一下同样的滋味",
      "source_evidence": "报复想法；希望对方受损",
      "source_evidence_category": "攻击报复",
      "variable_ids": [
        "PV02",
        "PV03"
      ],
      "context_only": false,
      "operational_mapping_status": "needs_review",
      "response_options": null,
      "score_rule": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "A04",
      "section": "A",
      "text": "即使很生气，我通常也能先停一下，再决定怎么做",
      "source_evidence": "暂停能力；自我控制",
      "source_evidence_category": "冲突调节",
      "variable_ids": [
        "PV01",
        "PV10"
      ],
      "context_only": false,
      "operational_mapping_status": "needs_review",
      "response_options": null,
      "score_rule": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "B01",
      "section": "B",
      "text": "我通常能注意到同学什么时候表面没事，其实心里很难受",
      "source_evidence": "识别他人情绪状态",
      "source_evidence_category": "共情",
      "variable_ids": [
        "PV04"
      ],
      "context_only": false,
      "operational_mapping_status": "needs_review",
      "response_options": null,
      "score_rule": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "B02",
      "section": "B",
      "text": "即使不喜欢某个同学，看到很多人针对他仍觉得不舒服",
      "source_evidence": "关注他人痛苦；反对伤害",
      "source_evidence_category": "共情保护",
      "variable_ids": [
        "PV04"
      ],
      "context_only": false,
      "operational_mapping_status": "needs_review",
      "response_options": null,
      "score_rule": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "B03",
      "section": "B",
      "text": "大家一起拿一个同学开玩笑时，我会想他是否真的觉得好笑",
      "source_evidence": "判断玩笑伤害性",
      "source_evidence_category": "伤害判断",
      "variable_ids": [
        "PV04",
        "PV05"
      ],
      "context_only": false,
      "operational_mapping_status": "needs_review",
      "response_options": null,
      "score_rule": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "B04",
      "section": "B",
      "text": "如果很多人都在做同一件事，个人承担责任会少一些",
      "source_evidence": "责任外推；群体免责",
      "source_evidence_category": "道德脱离",
      "variable_ids": [
        "PV05"
      ],
      "context_only": false,
      "operational_mapping_status": "needs_review",
      "response_options": null,
      "score_rule": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "B05",
      "section": "B",
      "text": "如果没有造成身体伤害，一些过分玩笑没有那么严重",
      "source_evidence": "弱化伤害后果",
      "source_evidence_category": "道德脱离",
      "variable_ids": [
        "PV05"
      ],
      "context_only": false,
      "operational_mapping_status": "needs_review",
      "response_options": null,
      "score_rule": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "C01",
      "section": "C",
      "text": "在同伴中，我比较在意自己的意见有没有分量",
